---
import Growth from '../../layouts/Growth.astro';
import Hero from '../../components/growth/Hero.astro';
import CTA from '../../components/growth/CTA.astro';
import OnboardingPlanner from '../../components/growth/OnboardingPlanner.astro';
---

<Growth
  title="Client Onboarding Checklist"
  description="What happens after you sign: one checklist, clear responsibilities, and a shared definition of ready to launch."
>
  <Hero
    eyebrow="Getting started"
    title="A good start makes everything after it better."
    intro="One checklist. Clear responsibilities. Everyone agrees on what “ready to launch” means."
  />
  <section class="section wrap">
    <div class="steps">
      {[
        [
          'Agree on the plan',
          'We confirm goals, what is included, which ad platform, fees, terms, and who does what.',
        ],
        [
          'Share access',
          'Use the checklist below to invite us to the required accounts. No passwords, ever.',
        ],
        [
          'Build and test',
          'We set up tracking, lead routing, and follow-up, get your ad creatives approved, and test everything.',
        ],
        [
          'Launch and review',
          'We do a final check together, launch, and set up your dashboard and monthly review.',
        ],
      ].map(([h, p], i) => (
        <article>
          <span class="number">Step {i + 1}</span>
          <h2 class="step-title">{h}</h2>
          <p>{p}</p>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section soft">
    <div class="wrap split">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">What we will ask for</p>
        <h2>Everything in the right place.</h2>
        <p class="intro">
          Each platform has a way to invite a team member with limited access.
          That is what we use. Never send passwords or customer records through
          this website.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <ul class="check-list">
          {[
            'Ad accounts (Google Ads, Meta Business Manager)',
            'Website access and who owns your domain',
            'Google Analytics and any tracking already installed',
            'CRM and pipeline, calendar, and lead routing ownership',
            'Email and text tools, and your existing permission records',
            'Logo, approved offers, and examples of ads you like',
            'Goals, how much work you can take on, and who approves things',
          ].map((t) => (
            <li>{t}</li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section wrap">
    <div class="notice">
      <strong>When the clock starts.</strong> Setup starts once we have the
      access, files, and approvals we need. If those are delayed on your side,
      the launch date and any guarantee window move with them.
    </div>
    <p class="after-notice">
      You get the exact checklist for your accounts during onboarding, with a
      walkthrough for each one. Growth Partner includes a live dashboard, a
      monthly summary, and a strategy call. Scale adds two calls a month.
    </p>
  </section>
  <OnboardingPlanner />
  <section class="section soft">
    <div class="wrap split">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Timeline</p>
        <h2>Access first. Then build in order.</h2>
        <p class="intro">
          Foundation is a 90-day setup project. The exact schedule depends on
          what is included and how quickly we get access. These are the phases,
          not fixed dates.
        </p>
      </div>
      <ol class="implementation-phases">
        <li>
          <strong>Before day one</strong>
          <p>
            Confirm the plan, the account owners, access, files, and approvals.
            We check that everything is in place.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Take stock</strong>
          <p>
            Review your tracking, how customers move from inquiry to sale, and
            the priorities we agreed on.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Build and test</strong>
          <p>
            Connect the systems, set up workflows, prepare campaigns where
            included, and test every form, call, and handoff.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Launch and hand off</strong>
          <p>
            Sign off together, launch, walk your team through how it works, and
            start the monthly reporting.
          </p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>
  <CTA />
</Growth>
